title: Install pills

Drag the following pill onto your wiki project to import it.

@@text-align:center;
<$link to="$:/plugins/flibbles/graph" class="graph-dragger graph-dragger-plugin">{{$:/plugins/flibbles/graph/icon|4em}}<br><<.graph>></$link>
@@

Now drag over at least one graphing engine for <<.graph>> to use.

@@text-align:center;
<$link to="$:/plugins/flibbles/vis-network" class="graph-dragger graph-dragger-engine">{{$:/plugins/flibbles/vis-network/icon}}<br>Vis-Network</$link>
<$link to="$:/plugins/lasjoh-toho/pinboard" class="graph-dragger graph-dragger-engine">{{$:/core/images/layout-button}}<br>Pinboard</$link>
<$link to="$:/plugins/lasjoh-toho/kanban" class="graph-dragger graph-dragger-engine">{{$:/core/images/list-bullet}}<br>Kanban</$link>
@@
